# NOTE: .env is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Stage 1-2 (Jenkins): the pipeline copies /opt/script/cloudcart/<service>/.env into this
# folder right before `docker build`, so it is baked into the image and read by dotenv.
# Task-definition environment variables still take precedence (dotenv never overrides
# an existing process.env value). Stage 3 removes the file and uses Secrets Manager.
# Locally there is no .env in this folder (docker-compose injects env), so nothing leaks.
